ed and remains one of the theatres in Mumbai that show Marathi movies."],["Shivaji Mandir","activity",19.02297,72.84206,"NC Kelkar Road, Dadar","","","","","r","Marathi plays are running in this theatre."],["Aaswad","restaurant",19.02516,72.84021,"Opp. Sena Bhavan, Shivaji Park, Dadar(W)","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"],["Diwa Maharashtracha","restaurant",19.0316,72.84192,"Kataria Marg, Takandas Kataria Marg, Dadar(W)","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"]]}